hadiths[15]{hadithnumber,text}:
"403","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Muthanna ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Safwan bin Isa ne hadith ki, Usama bin Zaid se, Zuhri se, Urwah se, Aishah se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum waris nahi banaye jate, jo kuch hum chhor dein wo sadqah hai."
"404","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne hadith ki, Abi Zinnaad se, Al-A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, ke unhone farmaya: Mere waris na koi dinar qismo karenge na dirham, jo kuch main apni biwiyon ke nafaqe aur apne kaam karne walay ke kharch ke baad chhor dunga wo sadqah hai."
"405","[AI-translation] Hamen Hasan bin Ali Al-Khalal ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Bishr bin Umar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Main ne Malik bin Anas ko suna, Zuhri se, Malik bin Aus bin Al-Hadathan se, farmaya: Main Umar ke paas dakhil hua to unke paas Abdur Rahman bin Auf, aur Talha, aur Sa'd dakhil hue, aur Ali aur Abbas aaye hue aapas mein jhagde mein the. To Umar ne unse farmaya: Main tumhein us Zaat ki qasam deta hoon jis ke irshad se asmaan aur zameen qaaim hain, kya tum jaante ho ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Hum waris nahi banaye jate, jo kuch hum chhor dein wo sadqah hai. To unhone kaha: Allahumma na'am. Aur is hadith mein ek lambi kahani hai."
"406","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne hadith ki, Asim ibn Buhdlah se, Zir bin Hubaish se, Aishah se, unhone farmaya: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) na koi dinar chhor dein na dirham, na bakri aur na oont. (Rawi) ne kaha: Aur ghulam aur londi mein shak karta hoon."
"407","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Sufyan ne hadith ki, Abi Ishaq se, Abi Al-Ahwas se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud se, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se, ke unhone farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe hi dekha, kyunke shaitan meri shakal nahi apna sakta."
"408","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Bashshar aur Muhammad bin Muthanna ne hadith ki, dono ne farmaya: Hamen Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Shu'bah ne hadith ki, Abi Husain se, Abi Saleh se, Abu Hurairah se, unhone farmaya: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe hi dekha, kyunke shaitan mere jaisi surat nahi ikhtiyar karta, ya farmaya: meri shakal nahi apna sakta."
"409","[AI-translation] Hamen Qutaibah ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Khalaf bin Khalifah ne hadith ki, Abi Malik Al-Ashja'i se, apne walid se, unhone farmaya: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe hi dekha. Abu Isa ne kaha: Aur ye Abu Malik Sa'd bin Tariq bin Ashyam hain, aur Tariq bin Ashyam Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahabiyon mein se the, aur unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se ahadees riwayat ki hain."
"410","[AI-translation] Main ne Ali bin Hujr ko karte hue suna, farmaya: Khalaf bin Khalifah ne kaha: Main ne Amr bin Huraith ko, jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahabiyon mein se the, dekha, aur main ek chhota ladka tha."
"411","[AI-translation] Hamen Qutaibah yani Ibn Sa'id ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Abdul Wahid bin Ziad ne hadith ki, Asim bin Kulayb se, unhone farmaya: Mujhe mere walid ne hadith ki, ke unhone Abu Hurairah ko karte hue suna, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe hi dekha, kyunke shaitan meri shakal nahi apna sakta. Mere walid ne farmaya: Maine is (hadith) ko Ibn Abbas ko sunaya, to maine kaha: Main ne unhe dekha hai, phir maine Hasan bin Ali ko yaad kiya aur kaha: Maine unhe unse mushabih bataya, to Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Beshak wo unki shakal jaisay they."
"412","[AI-translation] Hamen Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith ki, farmaya: Hamen Ibn Abi Adi aur Muhammad bin Jafar ne hadith ki, dono ne farmaya: Hamen Awf bin Abi Jamilah ne hadith ki, Yazeed Al-Farisi se aur wo musahif likha karte the, unhone kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko Ibn Abbas ke zamanay mein khwab mein dekha. Unhone kaha: Maine Ibn Abbas se kaha: Beshak maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko khwab mein dekha hai. To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Beshak Rasool Allah farmate thay: Beshak shaitan mere jaisi shakal nahi apna sakta, pas jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe hi dekha. Kya tum us shakhs ki sift kar sakte ho jise tumne khwab mein dekha hai? Unhone kaha: Haan, main tumhein do aadmiyon ke darmiyan ek aadmi ki sift karta hoon, unka jism aur gosht safaedi mael sawad rang ka tha, aankhein kaajal wali thi, hansi khoobsurat thi, chehre ke daire khoobsurat the, unki daadhi is se is tak bhar gayi thi, nehar ko bhar liya tha. Awf ne kaha: Aur is sift ke sath kya tha mujhe nahi pata. Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: Agar tumne unhe jagti aankh se dekha hota to tum is se zyada sift nahi kar sakte."
"413","[AI-translation] Hamay sunaya Abu Dawud Sulaiman bin Salm Al-Balkhi ne, hamay sunaya Al-Nadr bin Shumail ne. Kaha: 'Awf Al-A'rabi ne kaha: Main Qatadah se bada hoon."
"414","[AI-translation] Hamay sunaya 'Abdullah bin Abi Ziyad ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya Ya'qub bin Ibrahim bin Sa'd ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya Ibn Shihab Al-Zuhri ke bhatije ne apne chacha se, kaha: Abu Salamah ne kaha: Abu Qatadah ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe dekhe, yani neend mein, beshak usne haq dekha."
"415","[AI-translation] Hamay sunaya 'Abdullah bin 'Abd al-Rahman Al-Darimi ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya Mu'alla bin Asad ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya 'Abd al-'Aziz bin Al-Mukhtar ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya Thabit ne, Anas se: Ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo mujhe khwab mein dekhe beshak usne mujhe dekha, kyunke Shaytan meri shakal nahi akhtiyar karta. Aur unhon ne farmaya: Aur momin ka khwaba nabuwat ke chhiyalees hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"416","[AI-translation] Hamay sunaya Muhammad bin 'Ali ne, kaha: Maine apne walid se suna kehte the: 'Abdullah Ibn Al-Mubarak ne kaha: Jab tumhe qaza (faisle) mein mubtila kiya jaye to tum par asar (hadith) pakadna lazim hai."
"417","[AI-translation] Hamay sunaya Muhammad bin 'Ali ne, kaha: Hamay sunaya Al-Nadr bin Shumail ne, kaha: Hamay khabar di Ibn 'Awn ne, Ibn Sirin se, kaha: Yeh hadith deen hai, pas dekho tum apna deen kisse le rahe ho."
